data: {"sources": [{"file_id": "DuRk8Z-B68TR", "drive": "動画", "filename": "【買うなら今！】Amazonプライムデーで今買うべきおすすめアイテム『14選』.loft", "file_type": "video", "score": 0.04098360655737705, "match_types": ["tfidf_keywords", "transcript_keyword", "whisper"]}, {"file_id": "CmwTmVA8XRw5", "drive": "動画", "filename": "まるで生きてるみたい..。iPhoneに命を吹き込むロボット『LOOI』をご紹介します。.loft", "file_type": "video", "score": 0.04095740860446743, "match_types": ["clip_thumbnail", "transcript_keyword", "whisper"]}, {"file_id": "fqW9hJl8nv-7", "drive": "動画", "filename": "待ってたぞ..!! 6年ぶりに進化した「HomePod mini 2」がすごいぞ..。.loft", "file_type": "video", "score": 0.04032258064516129, "match_types": ["transcript_keyword", "whisper"]}, {"file_id": "mjP5XlIgml_H", "drive": "動画", "filename": "椅子は「冷える」時代へ。いまだかつてない、至高のワークチェアをご紹介します。｜LiberNovo Omni Pro.loft", "file_type": "video", "score": 0.03750815394651011, "match_types": ["transcript_keyword", "whisper"]}, {"file_id": "UVoAvUT9G1sI", "drive": "動画", "filename": "【iOS 27リリース!!】これぞ、最高傑作。今すぐ使いたい新機能をまとめてご紹介します。.loft", "file_type": "video", "score": 0.0234375, "match_types": ["transcript_keyword"]}]}

